WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.320
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.330
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.580
Good morning!

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.030
Everybody, check it and c'mon!

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.670
Johnny-sensei's such an early bird.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.440
So what did he just say?

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.200
Dunno.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.730
Kaede didn't get him either?

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.330
It wasn't English?

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:27.460
I was convinced that he was speaking English this entire time...

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.840
It's not the language of vampires either.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.680
He was telling us all to stand at attention.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.340
You can understand him, Mizuki-san?

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:38.620
Johnny-sensei and I go way back.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:42.090
Thank you, Beautiful Moon!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.040
Attention, please.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.110
There is only one reason that I have gathered you all together.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:51.710
It's time once again to determine the Academy's top idol—

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.880
the Starlight Queen Cup will soon be held.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:57.870
The Starlight Queen Cup...

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.210
If you become the Starlight Queen,

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:05.370
you will stand at the peak of not just this school, but the entirety of the idol world.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:10.510
I'm sure you're well aware, but only girls in the top eight of the Aikatsu ranking may enter.

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:12.880
And it just turns out that

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.560
you eight fill those spots.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.890
That means that the idol who will shine as this year's Starlight Queen is standing among you.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:22.680
Moreover, as I'm sure you all know,

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:27.320
the title of Starlight Queen has been held by Mizuki for the last two years.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:31.480
This is a rare chance for you to directly challenge the current top idol.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.780
Try and catch me. {Come at me, sis}

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.130
Yes!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.920
"Try and catch me".

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:15.920
Mizuki-san!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.860
She really makes you want to chase after her.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.590
But she's also the kind of person you can't catch no matter how much you chase her.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.050
If only she'd just stop for a bit...

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.830
She'd never wait, not for a second.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.300
But there was that year where she <i>did</i> stop.

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:34.240
Nobody knows what Mizuki-san was doing during the year she suddenly disappeared.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.260
I <i>do</i> remember you talking about that before.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.110
Ran, you know better than us, right?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:42.340
Yeah, it was the year right before she entered Starlight Academy.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:46.550
The only time Mizuki-san stopped her idol activities

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.750
was her last year of elementary school.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.770
Nobody knows what she was doing during that mysterious year,

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:58.380
but since she came back and took the idol world by storm, she must have powered up greatly.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.760
I'll never forget the aura she was giving off that day.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:08.390
She dazzled the stage during her comeback performance.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.440
Her aura was blindingly bright.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:14.130
Her singing, dancing, and overall stage performance

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:19.150
surpassed the current top idols' by miles and glued everyone's eyes to her.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:25.410
Don't you think she must've been doing some sort of intense idol training during her year offstage?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.930
That makes sense.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.810
Don't you want to know what she was doing?

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:30.660
I do!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.920
Same here.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.920
It might just be the key to overcoming Mizuki-san. {or "missing piece of the puzzle"}

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.130
Yeah!

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:38.630
Good, let's get investigating!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.670
Yeah!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:44.680
Oh? You're interested in what Mizuki was doing during her year in the shadows?

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.320
Yes, we really want to know!

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.720
We'll do anything to get even a step closer to her!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:54.020
We knew that Mizuki-san was working right now, so we came to ask you.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.690
Is there anything you could tell us?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.230
Please.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.180
I don't see why not.

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:08.450
As a testament to your passion, I'll introduce you to the man who was Mizuki's coach during her year off.

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.430
Mizuki-san's coach!

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:13.450
Thank you very much.

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:17.960
We appreciate the help.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:23.060
I wonder what kind of person her coach is?

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.900
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say he created the Mizuki-san we all know.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.970
He must be a master.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.970
It's not every day you get a chance like this.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:35.560
I wonder why he'd be in our lesson room though.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.840
Dunno.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.230
Do you think he's in?

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.360
Let's take a look.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.370
Huh? Johnny-sensei?

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.370
Oh, honeys. What's up?

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:59.910
We were told that the world-class coach who taught Mizuki-san would be here.

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:02.380
Sensei, have you seen anyone?

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.840
Maybe he went home already. {Why do I feel like I'm just unediting your lines}

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.830
Actually, about that...

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.890
I'm the man you're looking for, honeys.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.740
Me, over here, I'm Mizuki's coach.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.210
Oh, please.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.790
I wouldn't believe that in a million years.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.310
Stop kidding around.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.060
It's no joke.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:33.620
My special coach has always been and will always be Johnny-sensei.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:40.050
You sure know how to hurt a guy.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:43.540
I consider myself to be a top-class coach, personally.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.590
Are you serious, Mizuki-san?!

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.440
<i>Our</i> Johnny-sensei?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.260
<i>He </i>was your coach?

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.760
Correct.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.760
No way...

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.240
Yes way! {or change the previous line to "You're lying"}

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.460
He's so amazing.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:11.020
Yeah.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:11.740
Right.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.990
Is that really you, Johnny-sensei?

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.670
Not your mustache-less twin brother?

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:18.790
Heck no!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:25.800
Now you understand, right? Johnny-sensei is a top-class dance performer.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.760
He's also one of the best coaches in the world. {Mizuki can't have that many other coaches...}

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.560
Special yes!

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:34.180
It's still hard to believe.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.640
But I'm really impressed!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.760
I've come to respect you! {??} {???}

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:38.560
Me too!

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:42.270
So what you're saying is that you didn't respect me until now?

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.120
No, of course we did.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:44.990
Yeah.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.020
Really?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.610
So?

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.570
Don't you have something to ask Johnny-sensei now that you know that truth?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:56.020
Sensei, please give us the same special training as Mizuki-san!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:59.290
Even if it's by just a little bit, we want to get closer to Mizuki-san.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:01.830
Please.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.460
Are you sure?

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.800
Now you'll have to split your precious lesson time with those girls.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:20.060
Of course. I want nothing more than for them to catch up to me.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.850
What would you do if they overtook you?

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.860
Then I'd just have to pull ahead again.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.610
I'm feeling a strange sense of excitement.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.780
Those girls are seriously starting to come after me.

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:52.550
I wonder what kind of training Johnny-sensei has in store.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:56.260
He's always really excited during lessons, but he might turn it up a notch.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.760
And use more English than usual or something?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.020
If that happened, I wouldn't understand a single word that came out of his mouth.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.140
Now I'm nervous for more reasons than one...

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.040
Good morning!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.290
Hey there.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.150
Let's get started.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.360
Huh? He's acting normally.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.140
Yeah.

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:15.590
Normal all right.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:16.550
What?

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:20.410
Nothing, we were just wondering if you were going to have more energy than you usually do.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.910
Who knows, I might just be nervous because of these special lessons too.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.940
It kind of makes me feel better now that you've said that.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.860
Yeah, so please train us to the bone.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.170
We're counting on you.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:36.590
Just to warn you, my lessons will be extremely hard.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:37.540
Got it!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:44.180
After all, you're trying to master concepts that took Mizuki a whole year to take in.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.740
We're aware that this was an unreasonable request.

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.790
But we don't want to just give up now.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.190
We're ready for anything.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:53.090
Okay, then let's go and go.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.440
Follow through to the end!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.570
Yes!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:00.160
The most basic of the basics is the turn-and-smile.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.540
First and foremost, an idol must smile!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.780
Grit your teeth and show me those pearly whites!

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:08.540
Okay!

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:13.670
No, your expressions are scary, honeys.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.720
One more turn!

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.550
Yes!

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:18.800
No!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:22.470
No matter how much pain you're in, 
you have to smile on stage.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.640
Okay!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.680
Next up is the jump-and-smile.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.480
Jump to the sky!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.440
Yes!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.690
And... smile!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.820
No! Your faces are twisting again, honeys.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.960
We're sorry.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.200
Okay, one more!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.380
Right!

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:45.200
So hot...

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:46.700
Yeah...

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.210
I'm burning...

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:52.210
That's perfect! Idols are made of passion!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.920
Burn like the sun!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:58.000
Burn so brightly you put Mizuki's year with me to shame!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.260
So this is what Mizuki-san had to put up with that whole year...

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.020
She really is amazing.

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.760
Let's keep at it!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.020
Good job!

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.090
Let's take a little break.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:16.610
Sounds good, we've been going at this for three hours already.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:21.510
But even as we speak, Ichigo-sama, Aoi-sama, and Ran-sama

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:25.070
are getting special lessons from Johnny-sensei.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.740
I cannot see them taking breaks.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.060
That's probably true.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:32.150
Then perhaps it's not a wise idea to not continue our training?

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.130
Yes! Let's keep at it!

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:39.050
Love you! If everyone else thinks so then I won't take a break either!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.430
Sakura is getting fired up as well.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.650
There's one month until the Starlight Queen Cup.

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.060
This is no time to laze about my coffin.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.840
Okay!

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.960
Let's go! {screw it}

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.620
No!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.240
You won't be able to use good Special Appeals at this rate.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.410
Sorry.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.740
Listen up, honeys. You need to think hard about what a performance really is.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.060
What a performance is?

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.320
I don't know...

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:15.420
Performance... is life itself!

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.380
Life itself?!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:22.080
In one's life, a person will face happiness, sadness, and adversity.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.260
People express different emotions at each of those times.

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:30.450
It is your job as idols to convey those emotions from the stage to your audience.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.270
Use your entire being!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.140
Our entire being...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.150
That's right. Express with every part of your bodies.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.650
Express with your very being!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.400
With everything we've got...

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.660
Yes! Let's go!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.310
So tired...

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.740
His lessons really hurt.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.240
I can't move my legs.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.870
Me neither.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:59.380
So what do you think Johnny-sensei was talking about earlier?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.550
"Express with our beings," he said.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:05.550
Yeah. I kind of understand, but I'm not sure how to put it into practice.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:10.970
That's right, I don't really get how to use my entire body just to make a single expression.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.140
Yeah.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.310
Do you think Mizuki-san understood?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.480
I'm sure she did.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:20.940
The one thing I don't get is why Mizuki-san asked Johnny-sensei to be her coach in the first place.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.130
I was just wondering that myself.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:28.030
She wasn't even a student at the academy yet, 
so how did she get to know him?

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.520
If you want to know the answer to that,

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:36.080
then stop by my room tonight.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.500
Mizuki-san!

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.300
Have some of my specially made drink.

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:43.080
Thank you.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:45.550
Bitter!

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.680
It's Johnny-sensei's original recipe.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.580
It's not just good for you,

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:56.310
it trains you how to keep a smile even after drinking something so bitter.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.730
Johnny-sensei once told me,

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:04.180
"Become an idol who can laugh through the bitterness."

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:06.950
"If you can do that, you can make everyone happy."

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.120
I get it.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:11.230
So that's why Johnny-sensei was telling us to smile so much.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:14.700
The ability to make others happy is what makes someone an idol.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.910
That's what I think he was talking about.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:22.090
The reason I became an idol in the first place is because of the feelings I got from a certain pair of idols.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.530
A pair of idols?

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:24.790
Who were they?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.090
Isn't this...

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.210
It's Masquerade!

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.660
Yeah, the legendary idols, Masquerade.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:35.600
Mizuki-san, were you a fan of Masquerade's?

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.670
I still am.

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:40.590
But Masquerade was well before our time. {the were/was thing is a British/American thing}

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:46.060
That's right, they were long since retired by the time I was a toddler.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.860
Then how did you become a fan?

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.640
It was back when I was a fashion magazine model in elementary school. {eh}

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:55.490
I had a lot of worries then.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:59.050
About where my path was taking me,

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:01.250
and about what I should've been doing.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:04.800
I even considered leaving the 
entertainment world completely.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.260
Are you serious?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:11.760
But then, a person from my agency showed me footage of one of their concerts.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.760
It was of Masquerade's first concert.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.790
They stole my heart right then and there.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:21.770
I could see the joy on their faces even behind the masks.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:26.280
I could tell just how much they loved to sing and dance.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:31.030
Seeing them like that filled me with such bliss {fine...}

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:34.030
that I was able to stand up once again.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:40.040
That's when I decided to become an idol, just like Masquerade.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:43.540
My heart wouldn't calm down even after several days passed.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:49.650
Still, I couldn't help but wonder just why I was so moved by their performance.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:55.050
That's when I learned about the man behind Masquerade's choreography.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.060
Could that have been...

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.350
Yes, Johnny-sensei.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:07.320
But wouldn't he have been way too young back then?

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:12.690
Well, despite his youth, he must have been incredibly talented

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:15.570
to be chosen to do their choreography.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:23.080
After I found out, I couldn't help but follow after Johnny-sensei everywhere.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:26.580
I begged him to give me lessons.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:33.040
He must have gotten tired of me asking him day after day

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.590
because he eventually gave in.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.740
So that's how you met.

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:41.480
That's when my secret lessons began.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:45.730
I took an entire year off from work to become an idol.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:50.610
So that's why you stepped off the stage for an entire year.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.040
That's right.

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:55.160
Please teach me!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.280
No, you have to smile, Mizuki.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.780
And not just with your face— laugh with your whole being!

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.250
Cry with all your might!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.650
And have fun with everything you've got!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.830
It's exactly the same as what he told us.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:12.660
Yeah.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.490
So we really do have to use our entire beings. {ugh, Ran}

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:18.250
Yes. Even though Masquerade wore masks,

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:20.260
their expressions shone through.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:25.770
The way to remain in someone's heart is to turn your feelings into an expression of your being.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:31.280
Johnny-sensei created a stage for us to do that alongside Masquerade.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:36.030
Johnny-sensei really is more amazing than we gave him credit for.

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:45.860
To tell you the truth, I'm actually a bit envious of you three.

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.720
Even on a night as dark as this,

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:52.550
you can work to light each other up.

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:55.550
That's something I'm very envious of.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:02.560
I'm looking forward to the Starlight Queen Cup.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:05.560
Us too!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:10.560
And as sure as the day follows the night, the last day of our lessons with Johnny-sensei came. {...}

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.320
Honeys...

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.510
Good morning!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.700
Sorry for leaving all the mopping to you this whole time!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.580
We'll be in your care for one more day.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.080
We're counting on you.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:35.130
Okay, let's finish this up by seeing how much you honeys have grown in this time.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.350
Yes!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.410
Honeys!

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.670
Those were great smiles.

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:55.410
Thank you!

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:59.170
You are my treasure! You are shining stars!

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.370
"Well done!"

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:04.460
"You're my precious students."

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:06.680
"You all shone spectacularly."

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:08.650
Did we get it right?

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:11.180
Yes!

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.680
Thank you so much!

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:18.690
I'm not sure how much closer we were able to get to Mizuki-san,

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.200
but it's finally time for the Starlight Queen Cup to start!

00:23:55.540 --> 00:23:57.620
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.440 --> 00:24:01.810
Johnny-sensei, you didn't have a mustache when you were younger?

00:24:01.810 --> 00:24:04.340
A mustache brings out an adult's charm.

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:06.060
I think I prefer you without one.

00:24:06.060 --> 00:24:07.340
No!

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:09.760
Johnny has a backstory! {go ahead and change it, but at least make it a sentence}

00:24:10.460 --> 00:24:12.720
Even Mizuki-san admires Masquerade.

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:13.890
I wanna know more!

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:16.850
Now that it's come to this, 
we have to tail the headmistress!

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:18.140
Agreed!

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:19.470
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:21.730
Legendary Idol: Masquerade

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:25.280
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
